  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Protection sphere (Energy Resistance (aegis, ward)).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever a creature attacks the bearer of your Energy Resistance aegis, and the damage is reduced by that aegis, you may choose for that creature to suffer damage equal to the amount of damage reduced by the Energy Resistance aegis. The damage is of the same type as it was originally inflicted.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/protection#toc114\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
